<https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/portfolio-positions> a owl:Ontology;
    rdfs:comment "Portfolio membership and mandate, external holding and signed position snapshots, execution-derived lots, closed allocation and fee accounting, valuation header and lines, FX conversion, cost basis, unrealized PnL, and typed reconciliation semantics.";
